consider them against the originals;\ndo not assume either the old or the new statement is correct. If a real conflict\nwarrants correction, use the existing legal contradiction/retract_ids mechanism\nand separate replacement support only where this request permits it. A review\ncard itself never retracts or changes a value. During repair, retain the offered\nedit scope and immutable current-batch rows. Only offered frozen references may\nbe used; each covers its own source_ids only. Support from a new original does\nnot review an old obligated original. Claim an obligation only after warranted\nsettled review of every required original; otherwise leave it pending. Do not\ninvent agreement or call genuine partial/counter evidence irrelevant to close it.\n\n\nReturn one complete JSON object matching this schema:\n{\"additionalProperties\":false,\"properties\":{\"audit_verdict\":{\"enum\":[\"supported\",\"unknown\",\"conflict\"],\"type\":\"string\"},\"final_prediction\":{\"type\":[\"string\",\"null\"]},\"semantic_answer\":{},\"slots\":{\"items\":{\"additionalProperties\":false,\"allOf\":[{\"else\":{\"anyOf\":[{\"properties\":{\"observations\":{\"minItems\":1}}}],\"not\":{\"required\":[\"search_gaps\"]}},\"if\":{\"properties\":{\"reading_status\":{\"const\":\"no_relevant_evidence\"}}},\"then\":{\"properties\":{\"observations\":{\"maxItems\":0},\"unresolved\":{\"maxItems\":0}}}}],\"oneOf\":[{\"properties\":{\"observations\":{\"items\":{\"allOf\":[{\"if\":{\"properties\":{\"stance\":{\"enum\":[\"support\",\"contradiction\"]}}},\"then\":{\"properties\":{\"entity_scope\":{\"const\":\"SUPPLY project involving EHA\"},\"time_scope\":{\"const\":\"project specification\"}}}}],\"else\":{\"properties\":{\"value\":{\"type\":\"null\"}}},\"if\":{\"properties\":{\"stance\":{\"const\":\"support\"}}},\"properties\":{\"retract_ids\":{\"maxItems\":0},\"stance\":{\"enum\":[\"support\",\"partial\",\"unknown\",\"irrelevant\"]}},\"then\":{\"properties\":{\"value\":{\"minLength\":1,\"type\":\