e podcast and enjoy lighthearted conversations about the research stories behind the publications.\\n\",\"document\",[]],[\"s134\",\"d1\",5308,5681,\"This audio companion to our official journal is available on a range of podcast platforms, and we launch new episodes regularly.\\nCall for novel findings\\nHemaSphere is interested in high-impact studies that share novel findings.\\nIf your study fits this description, please feel free to submit it online for our consideration. HemaSphere does not charge any submission fees.\\n\",\"document\",[]],[\"s135\",\"d1\",5681,5991,\"Discounted publishing fees for EHA members\\nActive EHA members can benefit from discounted publishing fees in HemaSphere. Interested in publishing at this discounted rate? Learn more about joining EHA.\\nSubmit your paper\\nWe welcome your submission. On average, it takes us just 10 days to make a first decision. \",\"document\",[]],[\"s136\",\"d1\",5991,6347,\"If you have a manuscript that you think would be a good fit for our journal, please submit your paper. HemaSphere receives all manuscript submissions online.\\nRemember, active EHA members benefit from discounted publishing fees.\\nHemaSphere Editorial Board\\nHemaSphere’s Editorial Board is responsible for:\\nReviewing and selecting manuscripts for publication\\n\",\"document\",[]],[\"s137\",\"d1\",6347,6728,\"Guiding our journal’s quality, strategy, and growth\\nYou can find out more about the remit and composition of this body on the HemaSphere Editorial Board page.\\nJournal metrics\\nAs a premier hematology information resource, HemaSphere has:\\nA preliminary 2025 Journal Impact Factor (JIF) of 11.3 (source: Journal Citation Reports, Clarivate)\\nA Scopus 2025 CiteScore of 6.9\\nIt is also:\\n\",\"document\",[]],[\"s138\",\"d1\",6728,7029,\"Fully indexed in PubMed Central (PMC)\\nIndexed in Science Citation Expanded Index (SCIE)—Hematology and Clinical Medicine (Clarivate Analytics)\\nListed in the Directory of Open Access Journals (